[I] Flash STM32 ARM SoCs using built-in ST serial bootloader over UART or I2C

[T] stm32flash is an open source flashing utility to read and write the
[T] flash memory of STM32 microcontrollers through the built-in ST serial
[T] bootloader over UART or I2C. It supports binary and Intel hex files and
[T] can erase, verify and start execution.

[U] https://sourceforge.net/p/stm32flash/wiki/Home/

